{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/925056-paradox-wolf-and-20-books","id":925056,"title":"Paradox-Wolf and *20 books.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-02T14:53:53-07:00","id":925056,"title":"Paradox-Wolf and *20 books.","content":"Just noted an odd thing on the latest Shattered Dreams update. Is Para/Wolf involved in/vetting the *20 projects now? I thought the *20 stuff was going to continue being the CWoD and Para/Wolf was going to do its own post-apocalyptic/new system/weirdness.<br /> <br /> Because I'm really not liking the info we're getting on White Wolfs direction and I'd rather they stay the hell away from the good work OPP is doing......or am I worried over nothing? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T15:21:40-07:00","id":925066,"title":"","content":"Paradox own's the IP so they get final say and approval on all white wolf products.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T16:09:59-07:00","id":925082,"title":"","content":"Seemed to take them an awful long time....I guess I'll just be hopeful its a hands off vetting process and doesn't extend to warping OPP products to match ''4th Ed.&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T22:56:14-07:00","id":925229,"title":"","content":"The book where we know Paradox did request some changes to foreshadow 4th edition - V20's The Black Hand - doesn't seem all that different from other Onyx Path books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T08:41:12-07:00","id":925358,"title":"","content":"&quot;Know&quot; is a strong word for something someone posted on Reddit that doesn't seem to have been from the actual person that worked on the book; esp. since all of the supposed editorial changes Paradox was claimed to have wanted to make to the book didn't actually show up in the final product.<br /> <br /> Approval from Paradox is going to be slower than CCP, because Paradox's White Wolf team actually <i>cares</i> about the table top products; they're not just rubber stamping them after a cursory skim to make sure there's nothing insanely wrong with the books. There's zero evidence to support the idea that they're asking for significant changes to pre-promote the One WoD edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T10:01:22-07:00","id":925392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/925056-paradox-wolf-and-20-books?p=925358#post925358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Know&quot; is a strong word for something someone posted on Reddit that doesn't seem to have been from the actual person that worked on the book; esp. since all of the supposed editorial changes Paradox was claimed to have wanted to make to the book didn't actually show up in the final product.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wasn't talking about that. I remember Rich Thomas mentioning Paradox had asked for changes to Black Hand (Jyhad Diary as well, maybe?) to foreshadow 4th Edition. Might be me misremembering that they'd asked for changes to those books period, don't know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}